<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Taiwan electronic shrs basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Taiwan electronic shrs basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it issued 5.0 million American-style U.S. dollar composite call warrants on a basket of five Taiwan electronic stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> D-Link Corp			3   shares</p>
<p> Compal Electronic		3   shares</p>
<p> Delta Electronic		 2   shares</p>
<p> Hon Hai			    2   shares</p>
<p> Umax Data System		 2   shares</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$21.267     PREMIUM	 16.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$6.31	 GEARING	 3.75x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  01.APR.98     PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG    MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT		  US$23.63</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
